00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:29.620
just perfect it makes it so much easier
to have a relaxing romantic vacation the

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:34.810
mistake that so many writers make is
they have a problem with their story

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:39.040
design but they try to fix it through
execution so that's like you're in a war

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.120
zone let's turn the volume up so we
