better shape so I always start with

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:56.200
story design and make sure people I'm
sorry if I could back up so the key is

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.710
when someone's having a problem with
their script is it a problem with design

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:03.880
